WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.786
Yaa Sindou tãmbã sɩɩsã. Yaa senoufo lagem-n-taar a ye.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.938
Burkĩna soolmã sẽn be zĩ-zãnga wã, roogã pʋgsã yaa kãn-kãe. B yetame tɩ b pa be zaalem ye.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.120
Pĩnd wẽndẽ, Sinoufo tẽn-tẽng n da be zĩ-gõonegẽ wã, a ra vɩ ne bãane.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.424
Zĩig n vẽege, nao-rɩtbã yiime n na n yõg bi-bɩɩse.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.144
Roogã yõogame, t'a tẽngã zoe n kẽng weoogẽ.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.368
B kẽna yʋng wʋsg n tũud a Nakan sẽn yaa tãb-bi-poakã.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:22.200
Bi-ribl a ye ra wa n yɛɛsame. Ned ning sẽn tar pãng n yɩɩd a taabã rɩka-a.

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:25.350
A bee be! La kugã gũuda tõndo.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.906
B kolga tãensã roogo. Ned a ye zɩ n yã woto ye.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.900
A Nakan kõ-a-la kũun a sẽn yaa kãseng n yɩɩdã naoorẽ.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.808
Kɩɩmbã sɩɩs, solg-y tõnd.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:07.210
Dẽ, kugã yikame n bas zĩn - dãmbã tɩ b yi. B geta nin-kãensã sẽn pa tar soogã, la b reeg-b lame.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.328
B maana tẽn-kãnga pĩis sʋka, la b vʋʋgame.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:50.544
La daar a ye, b yãame tɩ b zoe n kẽnda.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.152
A Nakan yikame n bool zĩn-dãmbã.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:09.602
Tãnã kolgame. La kugã ra gilgdame, tɩ wed-bɛdbã yɛɛs wʋsgo.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.578
Sẽn da zao-a wã zoeeme. B pa leb n wa ye.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:38.848
La tẽn - kãng rãmb yɩɩ noog wʋsgo, la zĩn - dãmbã leb n kẽe kugã pʋgẽ.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:48.328
A Zeova pa leb n na n dɩ naam ne nin-kãensã ye.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:08.336
Rũndã-rũndã me, Sindou nebã waoogda kugã sɩɩs tɩ b kogl-b lame.
